      "VIOLET: Maud, you speak for me.\nMAUD: I can’t.\nALICE: It is written down.\nMAUD: No, I'm not. I'm not good at...",
      "ALICE: Please, we have no time.\nVIOLET: You can do it. You tell ‘em. Good luck Maud.",
      "VIOLET: Oi Maud, Mrs Ellyn’s invited you to tea.\nMAUD: Has she?\nVIOLET: She says you’ve gone and woken up the dinosaurs of Westminster."
